# h05 -- a deadlock through a lock that was in a slot.
#
# T1 reads table 1, its IS in a slot; T2 alters table 2; T1
# asks X on table 2 and waits for T2. T2 then asks X on table
# 1: its sweep moves T1's IS into the lock table, T2 waits for
# T1, and the cycle is found. The younger, T2, is the victim,
# and T1's X on table 2 is granted.


== pairing RR/RR == T1=RR T2=RR
@1 T1 begin -> ok
@1 T2 begin -> ok
@2 T1 lockoid 1 is -> ok
@3 T2 lockoid 2 exclusive -> ok
@4 T1 lockoid 2 exclusive blocks -> blocked
@5 T2 lockoid 1 exclusive -> deadlock
@4 T1 lockoid 2 exclusive blocks -> ok (resumed)
@6 check last T2 deadlock -> satisfied
@7 check last T1 ok -> satisfied
@8 T1 commit -> ok
@9 check committed T1 -> satisfied
